<%#
The fields every step of a bulk action carries: which action, which accounts, and the list to come back to.

## Local variables:

- `action`: the key of the action (super_admin.bulk.actions).
- `ids`: the numbers of the accounts.
- `back`: the address of the account list the operator came from.
%>
<%= hidden_field_tag :bulk_action, action, id: nil %>
<% ids.each do |id| %>
  <%= hidden_field_tag 'account_ids[]', id, id: nil %>
<% end %>
<%= hidden_field_tag :back, back, id: nil %>
